data: {"p":"/message/content/parts/0","o":"append","v":", more compact design\n    - No comparable expansion capability to the AC200L\n    <Link url=\"https://www.bluettipower.com/products/elite-200-v2-portable-power-station\" title=\"See Elite 200 V2\"/>\n  </box>\n</row>\n\nIf portability and battery longevity are priorities, I'd seriously consider the Elite 200 V2. If you want expandable capacity, RV connectivity, and greater solar flexibility, I'd favor the AC200L. <Cite refs={[\"turn956411product13\",\"turn956411search1\"]}/>\n\n## My recommendation: Three questions\n\nI can narrow this down considerably based on what you intend to power.\n\n{@body const [purpose,setPurpose] = DIL.useState(\"Home backup during power outages\")}\n{@body const [budget,setBudget] = DIL.useState(\"$750\u2013$1,000\")}\n{@body const [solar,setSolar] = DIL.useState(\"Yes, I'd like solar capability\")}\n<box border radius=\"lg\" padding={3} gap={3}>\n  **1. What will you primarily use it for?**\n  <radio-group direction=\"col\" value={purpose} onChange={setPurpose}>\n    <radio value=\"Home backup during power outages\">Home backup during power outages</radio>\n    <radio value=\"Refrigerator, freezer and essential appliances\">Refrigerator, freezer and essential appliances</radio>\n    <radio value=\"RV or camping\">RV or camping</radio>\n    <radio value=\"Whole-home backup\">Whole-home backup</radio>\n    <radio value=\"Solar power and off-grid living\">Solar power and off-grid living</radio>\n  </radio-group>\n  <divider color=\"subtle\"/>\n  **2. What's your budget?**\n  <radio-group direction=\"col\" value={budget} onChange={setBudget}>\n    <radio value=\"Under $500\">Under $500</radio>\n    <radio value=\"$500\u2013$750\">$500\u2013$750</radio>\n    <radio value=\"$750\u2013$","c":18}  

